flowchart TD
    A[Patient selects doctor and active DoctorService] --> B[Patient requests desired start time]
    B --> C[Load active DoctorService, validate doctor/service]
    C --> D[Check requested interval = start to start+durationMinutes]
    D --> E[Find active DoctorAvailability covering entire interval]
    E --> F{Covers fully?}
    F -->|No| G[Reject - outside availability]
    F -->|Yes| H[Check for overlapping active appointments for doctor]
    H --> I{Overlaps?}
    I -->|Yes| J[Reject - time conflict]
    I -->|No| K[Check overlapping appointments for same patient if policy requires]
    K --> L[Start DB transaction with locking/constraints]
    L --> M[Re-validate inside transaction]
    M --> N[Create Appointment with snapshots priceAtBooking/durationMinutesAtBooking]
    N --> O[Commit]
    O --> P[Booking confirmed]
    L -->|Constraint violation/race| Q[Rollback - handle conflict]
